Browser APIs (no license — provided by the user agent)
------------------------------------------------------

* Web Speech API (speechSynthesis, SpeechRecognition)
  Used for offline TTS / STT on the client device. The voices themselves
  (e.g. "Paola" on Apple platforms) are property of the respective OS
  vendors and ship with the user's device — CARA does not bundle them.

* Service Worker, Cache API, IndexedDB, localStorage, Fetch streaming
  Standard browser features.


